  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Developer Needs**\n\nI\'m currently focused on identifying the best n8n integrations for developers and envisioning their workflows. I\'m prioritizing integrations offering clear utility and ease of implementation. I\'m also preparing to provide setup instructions, ensuring they\'re straightforward. I am now working on a guide for initial configuration and suggestions for optimal system setup.\n\n\n**Expanding Integration Scope**\n\nI\'m now expanding the focus to include app integration! The goal is a dedicated \"Integrations & Templates\" section with interactive walkthroughs for key integrations. I am also working on adding a \"Form to CRM Contact Sync\" template. The response will include straightforward instructions for setting up n8n on their system, covering macOS, Linux, and Windows, with Docker or npm, including key configurations and webhook setup.\n\n\n"
