  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Navigation Links**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on updating `src/App.tsx`. I\'ve successfully added the fourth navigation link, \"Top Integrations,\" to Zone 2 of the top bar. I\'m using a `GitPullRequest` icon for now. Next, I\'m shifting focus to rendering the `<DeveloperIntegrationsView>` within the `<main>` section. I\'ll need to integrate `onLoadWorkflow` and `onGoToCanvas` soon.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
