  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Package Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently assessing the necessary packages for this monorepo project. I\'ve noted `lucide-react`, `motion`, `date-fns`, `express`, `react`, and `react-dom`. Now, I\'m carefully considering the user\'s request for a monorepo structure: `ci360-automation-hub/client/server/`. I\'ll evaluate if the existing dependencies sufficiently support this architecture or if further additions are needed.\n\n\n**Defining Project Structure**\n\nI\'m now outlining the project\'s physical structure. I plan to include folders for `database`, `docs`, and a `.env.example` file. Additionally, I\'ll create `package.json` and `README.md` at the root. Crucially, I\'m designing a full MySQL 8 schema in `database/schema.sql`, complete with seed data in `database/seeds.sql`. Finally, I\'m setting up backend models and repositories with API endpoints in `server/`, including routes for authentication, posts, brands, and integrations.\n\n\n**Developing API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m currently working on the API endpoints. I have to create a webhook caller and callback handler with HMAC SHA-256 verification at `/api/v1/integrations/n8n/*`. Additionally, I\'ll build endpoints for analytics and reports at `/api/v1/analytics/*` and `/api/v1/reports/*`, and audit logs at `/api/v1/audit-logs/*`. Now I am planning the full client application within `src/`, specifying UI elements like the header, collapsible sidebar, and mobile bottom navigation. I\'m focusing on defining 14 full feature pages & views, starting with the Overview Dashboard and its KPI cards and publishing performance chart.\n\n\n**Designing UI/UX Elements**\n\nI\'m now detailing the planned user interface and user experience components. Specifically, I\'m working on the design for key pages. I\'ve broken down an overview dashboard with KPI cards and performance charts. I\'m structuring a content management section, featuring a central content table. Finally, I\'m outlining a multi-step post composer including campaign setup, platform selection, media management and a powerful caption composer.\n\n\n**Elaborating Feature Specifications**\n\nI\'m now detailing the post-publishing flow. I\'m focusing on the \"Schedule\" step, considering immediate or timed publishing with timezone considerations and collision warnings. The \"Approval\" step involves assigning approvers, adding internal notes, and handling draft or submission states. I\'m also planning an autosave indicator for all of these features. Next, I\'m defining a content calendar with month, week, day, and agenda views, alongside platform icons, brand colors, and status indicators, with collision warnings.\n\n\n**Defining Feature Sets**\n\nNow I\'m detailing brand management, with grid and list views including logos, colors, timezones, approvers, and accounts, along with an add/edit modal. I\'m also specifying social account management cards for LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, and X, including connection status and token expiry. Additionally, I\'m working on the automation features, including n8n workflow cards with status, success rates, and associated brands. Finally, I am planning workflow execution monitoring via a detailed table view.\n\n\n**Specifying Data Outputs**\n\nI am now focusing on analytics and reports, specifically detailing reach, impressions, engagement rates, and other key metrics. I will ensure data export options to CSV, JSON, and PDF are readily available. I\'m also planning the full Google Sheets sync, which requires detailed import/export of a planning sheet and including specific columns, with sync status and row-level error validation. Finally, I\'m integrating team and role-based access control (RBAC), defining several roles, and implementing audit logs for security and operational activities, including Hostinger deployment status.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_601527"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"-- CI360 AUTOMATION HUB - Production MySQL 8 Schema\\n-- Charset: utf8mb4, Collation: utf8mb4_unicode_ci\\n\\nCREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS `ci360_automation` CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\nUSE `ci360_automation`;\\n\\n-- 1. Users Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `users` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `email` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n  `password_hash` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n  `full_name` VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,\\n  `avatar_url` VARCHAR(500) NULL,\\n  `phone` VARCHAR(50) NULL,\\n  `is_active` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,\\n  `failed_login_attempts` TINYINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `locked_until` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `two_factor_secret` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `is_two_factor_enabled` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  `updated_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  INDEX `idx_users_email` (`email`),\\n  INDEX `idx_users_is_active` (`is_active`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 2. Roles Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `roles` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `name` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n  `description` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 3. Permissions Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `permissions` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `code` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n  `description` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `category` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 4. User Roles Join Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `user_roles` (\\n  `user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `role_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`, `role_id`),\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`role_id`) REFERENCES `roles` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 5. Role Permissions Join Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `role_permissions` (\\n  `role_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `permission_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  PRIMARY KEY (`role_id`, `permission_id`),\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`role_id`) REFERENCES `roles` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`permission_id`) REFERENCES `permissions` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 6. Refresh Tokens Table (Rotation & Device Tracking)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `refresh_tokens` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `token_hash` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n  `device_info` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `ip_address` VARCHAR(45) NULL,\\n  `expires_at` DATETIME NOT NULL,\\n  `revoked_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  INDEX `idx_refresh_tokens_user` (`user_id`),\\n  INDEX `idx_refresh_tokens_hash` (`token_hash`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 7. Password Reset Tokens\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `password_reset_tokens` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `token_hash` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n  `expires_at` DATETIME NOT NULL,\\n  `used_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  INDEX `idx_pw_tokens_hash` (`token_hash`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 8. Brands Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `brands` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `name` VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,\\n  `slug` VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n  `logo_url` VARCHAR(500) NULL,\\n  `primary_color` VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'#1336E8\',\\n  `secondary_color` VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'#08C5E1\',\\n  `timezone` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'UTC\',\\n  `country` VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'US\',\\n  `default_approver_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `default_hashtags` TEXT NULL,\\n  `default_keywords` TEXT NULL,\\n  `is_active` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  `updated_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`default_approver_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n  INDEX `idx_brands_slug` (`slug`),\\n  INDEX `idx_brands_is_active` (`is_active`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 9. Brand Users Join Table (Tenant isolation)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `brand_users` (\\n  `brand_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  PRIMARY KEY (`brand_id`, `user_id`),\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`brand_id`) REFERENCES `brands` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 10. Social Accounts Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `social_accounts` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `brand_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `platform` ENUM(\'linkedin\', \'facebook\', \'instagram\', \'x\', \'youtube\') NOT NULL,\\n  `account_name` VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,\\n  `account_handle` VARCHAR(150) NULL,\\n  `profile_image_url` VARCHAR(500) NULL,\\n  `platform_account_id` VARCHAR(150) NULL,\\n  `connection_status` ENUM(\'connected\', \'expired\', \'disconnected\', \'error\') NOT NULL DEFAULT \'connected\',\\n  `token_expires_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `last_successful_publish_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `last_error_message` TEXT NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  `updated_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`brand_id`) REFERENCES `brands` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  INDEX `idx_social_brand_platform` (`brand_id`, `platform`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 11. Campaigns Table\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `campaigns` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `brand_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `name` VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,\\n  `description` TEXT NULL,\\n  `start_date` DATE NULL,\\n  `end_date` DATE NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`brand_id`) REFERENCES `brands` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 12. Posts Table (Core Content Entity)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `posts` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `brand_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `campaign_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `created_by_user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `assigned_approver_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `title` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n  `master_caption` TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  `first_comment` TEXT NULL,\\n  `hashtags` TEXT NULL,\\n  `keywords` TEXT NULL,\\n  `target_url` VARCHAR(1000) NULL,\\n  `internal_tags` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `country` VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'US\',\\n  `timezone` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'UTC\',\\n  `scheduled_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `published_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `approval_status` ENUM(\'draft\', \'in_review\', \'revision_requested\', \'approved\', \'rejected\', \'overdue\') NOT NULL DEFAULT \'draft\',\\n  `publishing_status` ENUM(\'idle\', \'scheduled\', \'processing\', \'published\', \'partially_published\', \'failed\', \'cancelled\') NOT NULL DEFAULT \'idle\',\\n  `rejection_reason` TEXT NULL,\\n  `version_number` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,\\n  `is_locked` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\\n  `external_sheet_id` VARCHAR(100) NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  `updated_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`brand_id`) REFERENCES `brands` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`campaign_id`) REFERENCES `campaigns` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`created_by_user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE RESTRICT,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`assigned_approver_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n  INDEX `idx_posts_brand` (`brand_id`),\\n  INDEX `idx_posts_approval_status` (`approval_status`),\\n  INDEX `idx_posts_publishing_status` (`publishing_status`),\\n  INDEX `idx_posts_scheduled_at` (`scheduled_at`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 13. Post Target Platforms (with platform-specific overrides)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `post_platforms` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `post_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `platform` ENUM(\'linkedin\', \'facebook\', \'instagram\', \'x\', \'youtube\') NOT NULL,\\n  `caption_override` TEXT NULL,\\n  `custom_media_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `publishing_status` ENUM(\'pending\', \'publishing\', \'success\', \'failed\') NOT NULL DEFAULT \'pending\',\\n  `platform_post_id` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `platform_post_url` VARCHAR(1000) NULL,\\n  `error_message` TEXT NULL,\\n  `published_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  INDEX `idx_post_platforms` (`post_id`, `platform`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 14. Post Media Items\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `post_media` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `post_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `media_type` ENUM(\'image\', \'video\', \'document\') NOT NULL,\\n  `file_url` VARCHAR(1000) NOT NULL,\\n  `original_file_name` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n  `mime_type` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\\n  `file_size_bytes` BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `width` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `height` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `duration_seconds` DECIMAL(8, 2) NULL,\\n  `alt_text` VARCHAR(500) NULL,\\n  `sort_order` TINYINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 15. Post Versions (Audit history of revisions)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `post_versions` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `post_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `version_number` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `changed_by_user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `master_caption` TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  `media_snapshot_json` JSON NULL,\\n  `platform_overrides_json` JSON NULL,\\n  `scheduled_at_snapshot` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `change_summary` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`changed_by_user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE RESTRICT,\\n  INDEX `idx_post_versions` (`post_id`, `version_number`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 16. Post Comments (WhatsApp/Instagram-style internal discussion)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `post_comments` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `post_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `comment_text` TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  `is_system_message` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\\n  `attachment_url` VARCHAR(1000) NULL,\\n  `reply_to_comment_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `is_edited` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  `updated_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE RESTRICT,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`reply_to_comment_id`) REFERENCES `post_comments` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n  INDEX `idx_comments_post` (`post_id`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 17. Post Approvals Activity History\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `post_approvals` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `post_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `action` ENUM(\'submitted\', \'approved\', \'rejected\', \'revision_requested\', \'superadmin_overridden\') NOT NULL,\\n  `action_by_user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `comments` TEXT NULL,\\n  `previous_status` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\\n  `new_status` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`action_by_user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE RESTRICT\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 18. n8n Workflow Mappings (Allowlist of dashboard-accessible workflows)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `workflow_mappings` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `workflow_name` VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,\\n  `n8n_workflow_id` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n  `webhook_path` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n  `description` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `is_active` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,\\n  `average_duration_ms` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `success_count` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `failure_count` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `last_executed_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `last_result_status` VARCHAR(50) NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  `updated_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  INDEX `idx_wf_n8n_id` (`n8n_workflow_id`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 19. Workflow Executions (Monitoring & Real-time Tracking)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `workflow_executions` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `execution_id` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n  `n8n_workflow_id` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\\n  `post_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `brand_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `initiated_by_user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `trigger_type` ENUM(\'manual\', \'schedule\', \'webhook_callback\', \'retry\') NOT NULL DEFAULT \'manual\',\\n  `status` ENUM(\'queued\', \'running\', \'success\', \'partial_success\', \'failed\', \'cancelled\') NOT NULL DEFAULT \'queued\',\\n  `duration_ms` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `started_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  `finished_at` DATETIME NULL,\\n  `sanitized_input_json` JSON NULL,\\n  `per_platform_results_json` JSON NULL,\\n  `error_summary` TEXT NULL,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`brand_id`) REFERENCES `brands` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`initiated_by_user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE RESTRICT,\\n  INDEX `idx_wf_exec_status` (`status`),\\n  INDEX `idx_wf_exec_post` (`post_id`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 20. Analytics Snapshots\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `analytics_snapshots` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `brand_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `platform` ENUM(\'linkedin\', \'facebook\', \'instagram\', \'x\', \'all\') NOT NULL,\\n  `snapshot_date` DATE NOT NULL,\\n  `impressions` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `reach` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `engagements` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `likes` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `comments` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `shares` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `clicks` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `video_views` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `followers_net_change` INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`brand_id`) REFERENCES `brands` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_brand_platform_date` (`brand_id`, `platform`, `snapshot_date`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 21. In-App Notifications\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `notifications` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `user_id` INT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,\\n  `event_type` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\\n  `title` VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n  `message` TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  `link_url` VARCHAR(500) NULL,\\n  `is_read` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n  INDEX `idx_notif_user_unread` (`user_id`, `is_read`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 22. Idempotency Keys (Replay & Double-Publish Prevention)\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `idempotency_keys` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `idempotency_key` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n  `request_id` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\\n  `action_name` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\\n  `payload_hash` VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,\\n  `response_status_code` SMALLINT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `response_body` JSON NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  INDEX `idx_idempotency_lookup` (`idempotency_key`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 23. Security & Operational Audit Logs\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `audit_logs` (\\n  `id` INT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `user_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `user_email` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `action` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\\n  `entity_type` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\\n  `entity_id` INT UNSIGNED NULL,\\n  `details_json` JSON NULL,\\n  `ip_address` VARCHAR(45) NULL,\\n  `user_agent` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `created_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\\n  INDEX `idx_audit_entity` (`entity_type`, `entity_id`),\\n  INDEX `idx_audit_action` (`action`),\\n  INDEX `idx_audit_created` (`created_at`)\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- 24. System Settings\\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `app_settings` (\\n  `setting_key` VARCHAR(100) PRIMARY KEY,\\n  `setting_value` TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  `is_encrypted` BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\\n  `description` VARCHAR(255) NULL,\\n  `updated_at` DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create comprehensive MySQL 8 database schema for CI360 Automation Hub with all 24 production tables\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/database/schema.sql\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating database schema\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create database/schema.sql\"}"
