  code_action {
    action_spec {
      create_file {
        instruction: "# CI360 AUTOMATION HUB\n\nProduction-ready social media automation dashboard and orchestration bridge for self-hosted n8n workflows. Create, review, approve, schedule, monitor, and report social posts across LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, and X with multi-tenant brand isolation.\n\n---\n\n## Key Highlights\n\n- **n8n Orchestration**: Dispatches signed HMAC SHA-256 webhooks with UUID request and idempotency keys to your self-hosted n8n instance.\n- **WhatsApp/Instagram-Style Review Chat**: Real-time internal approval conversation for every content item with avatars, message bubbles, timestamps, read checkmarks, and system status markers.\n- **Multi-Step Composer**: Step-by-step wizard for Brand & Campaign, Channels, Media validation, Master caption & platform overrides, Scheduling with collision detection, and Reviewer assignment.\n- **Enterprise RBAC**: Roles for Super Admin, Admin, Content Manager, Approver, Analyst, and Client with brand tenant isolation.\n- **Hostinger MySQL 8 Ready**: Complete SQL schema migrations (`database/schema.sql`), seeds (`database/seeds.sql`), and connection pooling for Hostinger Node.js Web Apps.\n- **Google Sheets Sync**: Bi-directional planning spreadsheet import and synchronization.\n\n---\n\n## Quickstart\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 2. Start development server (Express + Vite on port 3000)\nnpm run dev\n\n# 3. Build for production (client SPA + server compilation)\nnpm run build\nnpm start\n```\n\nDefault Development Credentials:\n- **Email**: `admin@ci360.internal`\n- **Password**: `Admin@CI360#2026`\n- **Role**: Super Admin\n\n---\n\n## Documentation Index\n\n- [Installation Guide](docs/INSTALLATION.md)\n- [Hostinger Deployment Guide](docs/HOSTINGER_DEPLOYMENT.md)\n- [n8n Orchestration & Webhooks Setup](docs/N8N_SETUP.md)\n- [Google Sheets Sync Setup](docs/GOOGLE_SHEETS_SETUP.md)\n- [Social Accounts OAuth Configuration](docs/SOCIAL_ACCOUNT_SETUP.md)\n- [REST API v1 Specification](docs/API.md)\n- [Security Architecture & RBAC](docs/SECURITY.md)\n- [User Guide](docs/USER_GUIDE.md)\n- [Troubleshooting Common Issues](docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md)\n"
        path {
          absolute_uri: "file:///README.md"
        }
        overwrite: true
      }
    }
