  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Data Structure**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the API delivers real, structured data from the repository, a key milestone! Next, I am focusing on verifying several documentation files: `docs/INSTALLATION.md`, `docs/GOOGLE_SHEETS_SETUP.md`, `docs/SOCIAL_ACCOUNT_SETUP.md`, and `docs/SECURITY.md`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_822763"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# CI360 Automation Hub Installation Guide\\n\\nStep-by-step setup guide for local development and self-hosted production servers.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Prerequisites\\n\\n- **Node.js**: v20.x or v22.x LTS\\n- **npm**: v9.x or higher\\n- **MySQL**: 8.0+ (or MariaDB 10.6+)\\n- **Self-Hosted n8n Instance**: Running on accessible network/VPS\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Environment Setup\\n\\nCopy `.env.example` to `.env`:\\n\\n```bash\\ncp .env.example .env\\n```\\n\\nConfigure your secrets:\\n```env\\nPORT=3000\\nDB_HOST=127.0.0.1\\nDB_PORT=3306\\nDB_NAME=ci360_automation\\nDB_USER=root\\nDB_PASSWORD=your_password\\n\\nN8N_BASE_URL=https://n8n.yourcompany.com\\nN8N_WEBHOOK_BASE_URL=https://n8n.yourcompany.com/webhook/ci360\\nN8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_32_character_hmac_secret\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Database Migration\\n\\nImport schema and default development seeds into MySQL:\\n\\n```bash\\nmysql -u root -p < database/schema.sql\\nmysql -u root -p ci360_automation < database/seeds.sql\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Run Application\\n\\n```bash\\n# Install dependencies\\nnpm install\\n\\n# Start development mode (Express API + Vite Dev Server on port 3000)\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\nOpen `http://localhost:3000` in your browser.\\n\\nDefault credentials:\\n- **Email**: `admin@ci360.internal`\\n- **Password**: `Admin@CI360#2026`\\n- **Role**: Super Admin\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create INSTALLATION.md documentation\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/docs/INSTALLATION.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating INSTALLATION.md\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create docs/INSTALLATION.md\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\375\003\n\372\003\001i\024}\023\003/\216%H\330:|\350yA\252\343E&\026\254r\"i[\202g\016\332\237\353\326\255\253\347\245\341\376\306\265\034\275.\207}t\215t\250\354(\326\3302\221:\302\232\3744\376\017\305a<?,:t\3317\312.:L\310\213K\337\373\3471\315:\325&U\233R\313\237\242\372\205N\230\373g\367\262S\322\301;HL\374\344\027\346;\b\313\230\352K\250\366]\236V\306>\317\331\264\361\232\003\210\300\243\372\177\307\355>w\347\256\303a#\036e\213\347\031\244\024!\025\363\210\372I\276M\276Q\223\366\321\nz\213\232\272\177lP\367\326U\240\252\364\316\350\335$\006\250\234 \315\326Xsq\v\361t\343\270\354]\341\227#G\256QR|p\302w1\"\324Q+\3154}R\274\344\037Z\025\001\374A\377@\337\212\266\024\325\322\331n@\374=\222\r\004wH\ae6S\352\3476x}\350\250V\bP\024<bw\350<\242Au\266(\343\270\221\256F\034Nt\350n\266\200\027TW\235\321-q\263\305\306\305\221N\223\000X*\345\036\324\212\370)m\271i.\r5\210D\221\2202\031\245\300\232\361\260\361\340\233\224\351\246\271\262\310\f\337\243\334\317\371\035\002C\267\254\020\230k\347\371\"\200+\314\267\242y\322\371|P;U\f\243C\253\2051\271#\302\026\244~5\257\032U\240>\312\247\352\320\317&Gy\327|\350\322\025\362\267\346\310\037C(\216\213\3223\016\321\261\352\233\217\222\316\316\036$\307\001\354\255\333\267X\314/\002n\021\305d`\247J\037\230\210\245\177eM\335\333\306\347\224G\343\346\360\324c\031p\306\206Y\022\366J\372a\034\376\021]h\374\037\203\204\313\322f\357\365]\233\000zs\311\354\202\257\262\301\267\306\026\021\374\204\f\210f5\374l\366\3132\273J\315e\332)\021%\""
