              text: "  4. Ensure `N8N_TIMEOUT_MS` in `.env` is set to at least 15000 (15s)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 2. Webhook Callback Rejected (401 Unauthorized / Invalid Signature)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Cause**: The HMAC SHA-256 signature generated by n8n does not match the server\'s `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET` or the request timestamp is stale (>300 seconds)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Solution**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  1. Verify the `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET` matches across both `.env` and your n8n environment variables."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  2. Check server time synchronization (NTP). Ensure system clocks are in sync."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Hostinger Database Connection Limit Exceeded"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Cause**: Shared hosting plans limit concurrent MySQL connections per user."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Solution**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - In `server/src/config/db.ts`, ensure `connectionLimit` is set to `5` or lower."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Check that all connections are properly released back to the pool after query execution."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 4. Post Schedule Collisions"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Cause**: Multiple posts are queued to release at the exact same minute on the same brand channel."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Solution**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Open the **Content Calendar** and look for amber collision badges."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Stagger posts by at least 15 to 30 minutes to maximize audience engagement."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
          }
        }
        absolute_uri: "file:///docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md"
        create_file: true
      }
    }
    use_fast_apply: true
    description: "Create troubleshooting documentation in docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md"
    diff_stats {
      additions: 42
    }
  }
}
