  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Mobile Interactions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on improving the mobile experience. Specifically, I\'m integrating mobile navigation interactions within `Header.tsx`. I need to add functionality to close open notifications or profiles when a user clicks outside of them. I\'m also planning to incorporate the `Menu` and `X` icons from `lucide-react` for the navigation toggle and will be using `useRef` to manage this behavior.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile Layout**\n\nI\'ve been examining the mobile layout more closely, especially how `Sidebar.tsx` interacts with `App.tsx`. I see that the fixed positioning on mobile takes up too much viewport space. I need to ensure the sidebar collapses or is hidden on smaller screens. I\'m considering conditional rendering using media queries or breakpoints to adjust the sidebar\'s behavior and the main content\'s layout. My goal is to optimize the mobile experience without disrupting the desktop layout.\n\n\n**Implementing Mobile Navigation**\n\nI\'m now concentrating on implementing a responsive, floating bottom navigation bar for mobile. I\'ll hide the sidebar on smaller screens and will show a drawer with an animated backdrop to offer access to navigation options, closing automatically upon selection. I\'m incorporating a hamburger button in the `Header` for easy navigation access. I\'m also ensuring the brand dropdown, date range, and search don\'t overflow on mobile. I\'m handling outside clicks to close the notification and profile dropdowns in the `Header`. Next, I\'ll address Team & RBAC functionality.\n\n\n**Designing Team Page**\n\nI\'m now drafting the `TeamPage` component. I\'m focusing on its structure, which includes a header with title, subtitle, search input, role filter, and an \"Invite Member\" button. There\'ll be a summary strip for key statistics, and a responsive table/card view. The mobile card view will display avatars, roles, emails, and action buttons. The desktop view will use a clean table with the specified columns.\n\n\n"
