  planner_response {
    response: "### Enhancements Completed\n\n1. **Full Team & RBAC CRUD (Add, Edit, Delete & Status)**:\n   - **Add Member Modal**: Added full user creation with name, email, role selection (`Super Admin`, `Admin`, `Content Manager`, `Approver`, `Analyst`, `Client`), tenant scope assignment (`Global`, `Nexus & Starlight`, etc.), and activation switch.\n   - **Edit Member Modal**: Allows editing member names, emails, roles, tenant scopes, and active statuses with real-time updates.\n   - **Delete Member Confirmation**: Confirmation dialog with an audit trail, complete with safety locks protecting the primary Super Admin account.\n   - **Quick Actions**: Inline toggling for Active/Inactive status and filtering by search query and role.\n   - **Backend API**: Added `GET /api/v1/users`, `POST /api/v1/users`, `PATCH /api/v1/users/:id`, and `DELETE /api/v1/users/:id` backed by transactional persistence and audit logging.\n\n2. **Click-Outside Dropdown Auto-Dismiss**:\n   - Added `mousedown`, `touchstart`, and `Escape` listeners to both the **Notification Bell** dropdown and the **User Profile / RBAC** switcher in the Header.\n   - Clicking anywhere outside either dropdown (or pressing Escape) immediately and smoothly hides it.\n\n3. **Mobile Responsiveness**:\n   - **Mobile Drawer Navigation**: Added a hamburger menu button in the Header (`< lg`) that opens an off-canvas drawer with an animated backdrop overlay.\n   - **Mobile Bottom Navigation Bar**: Fixed bottom bar providing 1-tap thumb navigation between **Overview**, **Content**, **Create Post**, **Queue**, **Team**, and the full menu.\n   - **Responsive Cards for Team**: On screens below 768px, the team table automatically transitions into high-touch cards with 44px+ touch targets for Edit and Delete actions."
    modified_response: "### Enhancements Completed\n\n1. **Full Team & RBAC CRUD (Add, Edit, Delete & Status)**:\n   - **Add Member Modal**: Added full user creation with name, email, role selection (`Super Admin`, `Admin`, `Content Manager`, `Approver`, `Analyst`, `Client`), tenant scope assignment (`Global`, `Nexus & Starlight`, etc.), and activation switch.\n   - **Edit Member Modal**: Allows editing member names, emails, roles, tenant scopes, and active statuses with real-time updates.\n   - **Delete Member Confirmation**: Confirmation dialog with an audit trail, complete with safety locks protecting the primary Super Admin account.\n   - **Quick Actions**: Inline toggling for Active/Inactive status and filtering by search query and role.\n   - **Backend API**: Added `GET /api/v1/users`, `POST /api/v1/users`, `PATCH /api/v1/users/:id`, and `DELETE /api/v1/users/:id` backed by transactional persistence and audit logging.\n\n2. **Click-Outside Dropdown Auto-Dismiss**:\n   - Added `mousedown`, `touchstart`, and `Escape` listeners to both the **Notification Bell** dropdown and the **User Profile / RBAC** switcher in the Header.\n   - Clicking anywhere outside either dropdown (or pressing Escape) immediately and smoothly hides it.\n\n3. **Mobile Responsiveness**:\n   - **Mobile Drawer Navigation**: Added a hamburger menu button in the Header (`< lg`) that opens an off-canvas drawer with an animated backdrop overlay.\n   - **Mobile Bottom Navigation Bar**: Fixed bottom bar providing 1-tap thumb navigation between **Overview**, **Content**, **Create Post**, **Queue**, **Team**, and the full menu.\n   - **Responsive Cards for Team**: On screens below 768px, the team table automatically transitions into high-touch cards with 44px+ touch targets for Edit and Delete actions."
