  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Optimizing Header Layout**\n\nI\'m currently focused on responsive design for `Header.tsx`. My latest thinking involves hiding the search input on smaller screens (<1280px) and displaying it only on larger ones. Also, the brand selector on smaller screens (less than sm) should be compact. I am still developing the best methods for this change.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_681834"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Optimize Header responsiveness for all screens from small mobile to tablet and desktop\", \"EndLine\":140, \"Instruction\":\"Update Header elements for optimal responsive sizing and spacing\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"    <header className=\\\"h-16 px-3 sm:px-6 bg-white border-b border-[#EAECF0] flex items-center justify-between gap-2 sm:gap-4 sticky top-0 z-30\\\">\\n      {/* Left: Mobile Drawer Trigger + Brand Switcher + Global Search */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0\\\">\\n        {/* Mobile Hamburger Drawer Toggle */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onToggleMobileMenu}\\n          className=\\\"lg:hidden p-2 rounded-xl text-[#344054] hover:bg-[#F2F4F7] transition-colors shrink-0\\\"\\n          aria-label={isMobileMenuOpen ? \'Close navigation drawer\' : \'Open navigation drawer\'}\\n          title=\\\"Toggle Navigation\\\"\\n        >\\n          {isMobileMenuOpen ? <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" /> : <Menu className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />}\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Brand Dropdown */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative shrink-0\\\">\\n          <select\\n            value={selectedBrandId || \'\'}\\n            onChange={e => onSelectBrand(e.target.value ? Number(e.target.value) : null)}\\n            className=\\\"h-9 pl-2.5 pr-7 sm:pl-3 sm:pr-8 bg-[#F6F8FC] border border-[#D0D5DD] rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold text-[#101828] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#1336E8] cursor-pointer appearance-none transition-colors max-w-[125px] sm:max-w-[180px] md:max-w-[220px] truncate\\\"\\n          >\\n            <option value=\\\"\\\">All Brands ({brands.length})</option>\\n            {brands.map(b => (\\n              <option key={b.id} value={b.id}>\\n                {b.name}\\n              </option>\\n            ))}\\n          </select>\\n          <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#667085] absolute right-2 sm:right-2.5 top-3 pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Global Search - shown on xl screens to maintain breathing space on tablet */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative flex-1 hidden xl:block max-w-md\\\">\\n          <Search className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#667085] absolute left-3 top-2.5\\\" />\\n          <input\\n            type=\\\"text\\\"\\n            placeholder=\\\"Search posts, campaigns, tags...\\\"\\n            className=\\\"w-full h-9 pl-9 pr-3 bg-[#F6F8FC] border border-[#D0D5DD] rounded-xl text-xs text-[#101828] placeholder-[#667085] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#1336E8] transition-colors\\\"\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Right: n8n Status, Date Range, Notifications & User */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n        {/* n8n Status Pill */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onOpenN8nStatus}\\n          className=\\\"h-8 px-2 sm:px-2.5 rounded-lg border border-[#D0D5DD] bg-[#F6F8FC] hover:bg-[#F2F4F7] flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#344054] transition-colors shrink-0\\\"\\n          title=\\\"Click to view n8n Orchestrator status\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#12B76A] ring-2 ring-[#12B76A]/20\\\"></span>\\n          <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline font-mono\\\">n8n Connected</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Date Range Selector (Hidden on mobile & tablet) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden 2xl:flex items-center gap-1.5 h-8 px-2.5 bg-[#F6F8FC] border border-[#D0D5DD] rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-[#344054]\\\">\\n          <Calendar className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#667085]\\\" />\\n          <span>{dateRange}</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Notifications Bell Dropdown */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative shrink-0\\\" ref={notifRef}>\", \"StartLine\":78, \"TargetContent\":\"    <header className=\\\"h-16 px-3 sm:px-6 bg-white border-b border-[#EAECF0