  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Request**\n\nI\'m focusing on the user\'s intent. They want a \"direct n8n login page.\" It seems they\'re bypassing some intermediary, seeking immediate access to the login interface of an n8n application. I need to understand why they want this, and what the application \"CI\" does.\n\n\n**Exploring Login Flows**\n\nI\'m now investigating potential integration points. The goal is to provide a streamlined way to access and manage n8n instances. My focus has shifted to the `Sidebar.tsx` file, specifically the \"Automations (n8n)\" entry. I\'m exploring the possibility of adding a dedicated \"n8n Direct Login\" or similar tab within the navigation. I also started a review of existing authentication flows to understand the current login processes.\n\n\n"
