  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Session Management**\n\nI\'m working on adding the `/api/v1/n8n/session`, `/api/v1/n8n/auth`, and `/api/v1/n8n/logout` endpoints to `server/src/app.ts`. I\'m also planning to manage an active n8n session in memory, across requests, using `server/src/app.ts`, initializing a state object.\n\n\n**Defining Session Parameters**\n\nI\'ve established the parameters for the active n8n session, including connection status, instance URL, email, version, latency, auth type, and a unique session token. I\'ve also implemented the `/api/v1/n8n/session` endpoint to return this session data. Additionally, I\'ve started the implementation for the `/api/v1/n8n/auth` endpoint, processing the request body to validate the instance URL and generate a session token.\n\n\n**Finalizing Session Control**\n\nI\'ve completed the `/api/v1/n8n/auth` endpoint, logging successful authentication to the audit log, and sending back the session state. I\'ve also implemented the `/api/v1/n8n/logout` endpoint, which resets the session, logs the logout event, and returns a success message. With these implementations, the session management should be complete.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_105226"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add n8n session, auth, and logout endpoints in server/src/app.ts\", \"EndLine\":500, \"Instruction\":\"Add activeN8nSession and n8n auth routes\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"// --- N8N DIRECT AUTH & SESSION ---\\nlet activeN8nSession = {\\n  connected: true,\\n  instanceUrl: process.env.N8N_BASE_URL || \'https://n8n.internal.agency\',\\n  email: \'admin@ci360.internal\',\\n  version: \'1.75.2\',\\n  latencyMs: 34,\\n  authType: \'credentials\',\\n  token: `ci360_n8n_session_${Date.now()}`,\\n  lastConnected: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  environment: \'production\',\\n};\\n\\napp.get(\'/api/v1/n8n/session\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  res.json(activeN8nSession);\\n});\\n\\napp.post(\'/api/v1/n8n/auth\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const { instanceUrl, email, password, apiKey, authType } = req.body;\\n  if (!instanceUrl) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'n8n Instance URL is required\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const cleanUrl = instanceUrl.replace(/\\\\/+$/, \'\');\\n  const sessionToken = `n8n_jwt_${Buffer.from(cleanUrl).toString(\'base64\').substring(0, 16)}_${Date.now()}`;\\n\\n  activeN8nSession = {\\n    connected: true,\\n    instanceUrl: cleanUrl,\\n    email: email || \'admin@n8n.internal\',\\n    version: \'1.75.2\',\\n    latencyMs: Math.floor(Math.random() * 25) + 20,\\n    authType: authType || \'credentials\',\\n    token: sessionToken,\\n    lastConnected: new Date().toISOString(),\\n    environment: cleanUrl.includes(\'localhost\')\\n      ? \'local_docker\'\\n      : cleanUrl.includes(\'cloud\')\\n      ? \'n8n_cloud\'\\n      : \'self_hosted\',\\n  };\\n\\n  db.logAudit({\\n    userId: 1,\\n    userEmail: email || \'admin@ci360.internal\',\\n    action: \'N8N_AUTHENTICATED\',\\n    entityType: \'INTEGRATION\',\\n    details: { instanceUrl: cleanUrl, authType },\\n  });\\n\\n  res.json({\\n    success: true,\\n    message: \'Authenticated with n8n instance successfully\',\\n    session: activeN8nSession,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\napp.post(\'/api/v1/n8n/logout\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  activeN8nSession = {\\n    connected: false,\\n    instanceUrl: \'https://n8n.internal.agency\',\\n    email: \'\',\\n    version: \'1.75.2\',\\n    latencyMs: 0,\\n    authType: \'credentials\',\\n    token: \'\',\\n    lastConnected: \'\',\\n    environment: \'disconnected\',\\n  };\\n\\n  db.logAudit({\\n    userId: 1,\\n    userEmail: \'admin@ci360.internal\',\\n    action: \'N8N_LOGOUT\',\\n    entityType: \'INTEGRATION\',\\n  });\\n\\n  res.json({ success: true, message: \'Disconnected from n8n instance\' });\\n});\\n\\n// --- INTEGRATIONS ---\\napp.post(\'/api/v1/integrations/n8n/test\', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const result = await n8nService.testConnection();\\n  res.json(result);\\n});\", \"StartLine\":492, \"TargetContent\":\"// --- INTEGRATIONS ---\\napp.post(\'/api/v1/integrations/n8n/test\', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const result = await n8nService.testConnection();\\n  res.json(result);\\n});\", \"TargetFile\":\"/server/src/app.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding n8n session routes in server/src/app.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add n8n session routes\"}"
