  planner_response {
    response: "A dedicated **Direct n8n Login & Console Gateway** has been implemented.\n\n### What was added:\n1. **Direct n8n Login Page (`N8nDirectLoginPage.tsx`)**:\n   - **Official Co-Branded n8n Interface**: Signature n8n coral-pink branding with real-time connectivity status and latency metrics.\n   - **Environment Switcher**: 1-click presets for **Production Agency Cluster** (`https://n8n.internal.agency`), **n8n Cloud** (`https://app.n8n.cloud`), and **Local Docker** (`http://localhost:5678`), plus custom Hostinger/VPS URLs.\n   - **Authentication Modes**:\n     - **Email & Password**: Direct login with prefilled administrator credentials and password visibility toggle.\n     - **API Key & HMAC Secret**: Authenticate using `X-N8N-API-KEY` and webhook secret key.\n     - **1-Click SSO Launch**: Direct single sign-on redirect into the n8n web console.\n   - **Session Status Panel**: Live latency ping tester, engine version info, copyable endpoints, and instant session disconnect/switch.\n   - **Docker & CLI Helper**: Quick-copy Docker command to run a local n8n instance on port 5678 in one line.\n\n2. **Navigation & Access Points**:\n   - **Sidebar**: Added **Direct n8n Login** to the main navigation menu.\n   - **Header Pill**: Clicking the top-bar **n8n Connected** status pill now navigates directly to the login portal.\n   - **Automations Tab**: Prominent **Direct n8n Login** button added to the header of the Workflows & Automations view.\n\n3. **Backend API Endpoints**:\n   - `GET /api/v1/n8n/session`: Inspect active instance session and ping health.\n   - `POST /api/v1/n8n/auth`: Authenticate and persist session credentials with audit logging.\n   - `POST /api/v1/n8n/logout`: Disconnect and switch instances."
    thinking: "**Verifying Login Requirements**\n\nOkay, I\'m now actively verifying each component of the \"direct n8n login\" request. I\'ve confirmed the existence of the `N8nDirectLoginPage.tsx` file for a dedicated page. Next, I\'m checking for the necessary sidebar navigation item, and I\'ll confirm the presence of the \"n8n Connected\" header. I\'m focusing on ensuring every element is present and functioning as expected.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "A dedicated **Direct n8n Login & Console Gateway** has been implemented.\n\n### What was added:\n1. **Direct n8n Login Page (`N8nDirectLoginPage.tsx`)**:\n   - **Official Co-Branded n8n Interface**: Signature n8n coral-pink branding with real-time connectivity status and latency metrics.\n   - **Environment Switcher**: 1-click presets for **Production Agency Cluster** (`https://n8n.internal.agency`), **n8n Cloud** (`https://app.n8n.cloud`), and **Local Docker** (`http://localhost:5678`), plus custom Hostinger/VPS URLs.\n   - **Authentication Modes**:\n     - **Email & Password**: Direct login with prefilled administrator credentials and password visibility toggle.\n     - **API Key & HMAC Secret**: Authenticate using `X-N8N-API-KEY` and webhook secret key.\n     - **1-Click SSO Launch**: Direct single sign-on redirect into the n8n web console.\n   - **Session Status Panel**: Live latency ping tester, engine version info, copyable endpoints, and instant session disconnect/switch.\n   - **Docker & CLI Helper**: Quick-copy Docker command to run a local n8n instance on port 5678 in one line.\n\n2. **Navigation & Access Points**:\n   - **Sidebar**: Added **Direct n8n Login** to the main navigation menu.\n   - **Header Pill**: Clicking the top-bar **n8n Connected** status pill now navigates directly to the login portal.\n   - **Automations Tab**: Prominent **Direct n8n Login** button added to the header of the Workflows & Automations view.\n\n3. **Backend API Endpoints**:\n   - `GET /api/v1/n8n/session`: Inspect active instance session and ping health.\n   - `POST /api/v1/n8n/auth`: Authenticate and persist session credentials with audit logging.\n   - `POST /api/v1/n8n/logout`: Disconnect and switch instances."
