  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Architecture**\n\nI\'m solidifying the initial architecture. I\'ve introduced a template, `tpl-x-social-orchestrator`, as the foundation. It focuses on omnichannel publishing, particularly for X (Twitter). I am currently defining the component nodes: `webhook` for inbound events, and various further processing nodes that aren\'t yet named.\n\n\n**Refining the Workflow**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out the processing nodes. I\'ve fleshed out `code` for AI-powered formatting, and `xNode` for posting. Conditional logic for thread handling via `if` and additional `xNode` for replies is now defined, along with a notification step via `slackWebhook`.\n\n\n"
