  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining xNode Functionality**\n\nI\'m now outlining the features for the `xNode` configuration block, specifically. I\'ve started by creating an \"Operation Selector\". The initial operations I\'ve defined are `createTweet` (for standard text and media tweets), and `replyTweet` (for replying to tweets or starting a thread). Next, I plan on adding the parameters for these operations, and then expand from there.\n\n\n**Expanding Operation Library**\n\nI\'ve been occupied with expanding the operation library. I\'ve integrated operations for searching tweets, getting user profiles, liking tweets, and retweeting. Also, I\'ve outlined authentication with details on credential types, required fields, and the \"Test Twitter / X API Credentials\" functionality, to be as helpful as possible for the expert user. The next stage is creating the parameters for each operation.\n\n\n"
