  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Expanding Automations Hub**\n\nI\'m now expanding the `AutomationsPage.tsx`. My current focus is to integrate a mode switcher with tabs at the top. The first tab, which I have tentatively labeled \"Active Pipelines\", should be up and running soon. My goal is to create a dynamic hub for n8n automations.\n\n\n**Developing Workflow Interface**\n\nI am now focusing on the \"Visual Workflow Canvas\". I\'ve planned a header with workflow selection, an \"Add Node\" button (which will open the `NodeLibraryModal` with `xNode` available), and a quick \"+ Add Node X\" shortcut button with an instant X icon. I also want a \"Run Entire Workflow\" button and an \"n8n JSON Schema\" button. The canvas will be interactive and clicking on any node should open the `NodeInspector`.\n\n\n"
