  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating the Visual Canvas**\n\nI\'m now diving into `src/features/workflows/AutomationsPage.tsx` to integrate the n8n Visual Canvas and Node Builder. The plan is to start with the top section, which will feature a header, \"Automations & Workflows (n8n Engine\".\n\n\n**Designing the UI Elements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the user interface elements for the Visual Workflow Canvas. I\'ve defined the main sections: \"Active Pipelines,\" \"Visual Workflow Canvas,\" \"Developer Integrations,\" and \"Webhook Sandbox & Testing.\" The \"Visual Workflow Canvas\" will feature an interactive canvas with a top toolbar and example workflow templates for users to select.\n\n\n**Defining Workflow Interactions**\n\nI\'m now outlining key workflow interactions. I\'m focusing on features such as instant Twitter node addition with pre-configured credentials via a \"+ Add Node X\" button, a \"Run Workflow Test\" button to visualize workflow execution, and an \"Export n8n JSON\" button for code sharing. The canvas will be dynamic, featuring node-wire interactions, zoom controls, and a right-side `NodeInspector` that triggers test steps.\n\n\n"
