    thinking: "**Analyzing Node Positions**\n\nI\'m currently examining the provided node positions. I see a mostly linear arrangement with `node-x-1` through `node-x-4` on a horizontal line. `node-x-5` and `node-x-6` have vertical offset from the horizontal line. My current objective is to figure out how to optimize this arrangement, but I\'m not clear on what objective function I should use.\n\n\n**Refining Node Inspection**\n\nI\'ve been improving node inspection. I\'ve adjusted `selectedNodeId` initialization to `null` to avoid an automatically open inspector. I\'ve also added a \"Inspect Node X\" button to the toolbar, which sets `selectedNodeId` to `\'node-x-3\'`. Finally, I\'ve noted some elements of the canvas container.\n\n\n**Optimizing Canvas Layout**\n\nI\'ve made significant progress optimizing the canvas layout. I fixed a collapsing `div` height issue by setting `h-[640px] w-full`. Now, `WorkflowCanvas` correctly inherits the 640px height. Furthermore, when the `NodeInspector` is open, it cleverly uses `absolute inset-y-0 right-0 z-30` positioning, keeping the page header and tabs clean. I also added a helpful overlay badge for when no node is selected, located at the top-right of the canvas.\n\n\n"
